{"id": "PLoROMvodv4rOCXd21gf0CF4xr35yINeOy", "title": "Stanford CME295: Transformers and Large Language Models I Autumn 2025", "description": "This course explores the world of Transformers and Large Language Models (LLMs). You will learn the evolution of NLP methods, the core components of the Transformer architecture, along with how they relate to LLMs as well as techniques to enhance model performance for real-world applications.\n\nThrough a mix of theory and practical insights, this course will equip you with the knowledge to leverage LLMs effectively.\n\nVisit the course website: https://cme295.stanford.edu/syllabus/\n\nAfshine Amidi is an Adjunct Lecturer at Stanford University.\n\nShervine Amidi is an Adjunct Lecturer at Stanford University.", "tags": [], "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ub3GoFaUcds/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEWCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDCQgBFQAAiEIYAQ==&rs=AOn4CLDpvOEa5CXb37kfUKqZuA4j0SAD_A", "height": 94, "width": 168, "id": "0", "resolution": "168x94"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ub3GoFaUcds/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEWCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDCQgBFQAAiEIYAQ==&rs=AOn4CLAauvDY9DjQ_VruFDZHPpOJ1-qzZg", "height": 110, "width": 196, "id": "1", "resolution": "196x110"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ub3GoFaUcds/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEXCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAwkIARUAAIhCGAE=&rs=AOn4CLDC4m_iXCN42IZX6UumhZ9RU0lwXQ", "height": 138, "width": 246, "id": "2", "resolution": "246x138"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ub3GoFaUcds/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEXCNACELwBSFryq4qpAwkIARUAAIhCGAE=&rs=AOn4CLA_-xmSvc3mnp8dadgFuighuJTNFg", "height": 188, "width": 336, "id": "3", "resolution": "336x188"}], "modified_date": "20251209", "view_count": 223147, "playlist_count": 9, "channel": "Stanford Online", "channel_id": "UCBa5G_ESCn8Yd4vw5U-gIcg", "uploader_id": "@stanfordonline", "uploader": "Stanford Online", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBa5G_ESCn8Yd4vw5U-gIcg", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@stanfordonline", "_type": "playlist", "extractor_k